              "correctChoice": "c1",
              "explanation": "AB上ではAP＝xで、CからABへの高さはBC＝4。"
            },
            {
              "question": "面積と区間は？",
              "choices": [
                {
                  "id": "c1",
                  "text": "y＝2x、0≦x≦6"
